Third-party material in the Antirion console
============================================

Provider and model maker brand marks
------------------------------------

src/components/ui/brand-marks.tsx holds the path data of these SVGs from
@lobehub/icons-static-svg 1.70.0 (https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-icons), under
the MIT licence: openai, azure, anthropic, bedrock, vertexai, gemini, mistral,
cohere, groq, together, fireworks, deepseek, xai, cerebras, deepinfra,
perplexity, huggingface, replicate, aws, ibm, ollama, nvidia, meta, qwen,
microsoft, nova, ai21, kimi, zhipu and minimax. The marks were reduced to their
paths (no inline styles) and are drawn in the current text colour. The brand
names and logos remain the trademarks of their owners and are shown only to name
the provider a gateway connects to or the maker of a model it serves.

